The bake tree of the nrc-scatter caches: patches/bake/kernel.diff, then this patch (kernel_tree.sh <checkout> <out> bake-scatter).
1. The nrc2 variants of the render tree (patches/kernel/09-mergeN.diff), among them the scattered form of the cache
   query (NRC2_SCATTER = -DNRC2_FLAGS_C=1): a path stashes or queries a vertex before its bounce, with the direction
   towards the previous vertex, and the target is the radiance the vertex scatters that way.
2. Grouped training samples (-DNRC_GROUP_N=N): N consecutive samples of a pixel are tagged together and share one
   camera sample, so they reach the same first vertex; nrc_stash writes the group key into the record's padding word.

